/// The platform's email: who owns it and where emails come from, and the
/// provider that sends them (Resend, or any SMTP server). Grafana sends its
/// password resets and alerts through it, to the owner; the backup tells
/// the owner when it fails; Let's Encrypt writes to the owner; and each app
/// gets MAIL_URL from it, unless the app's own secrets set one. task
/// mail:test sends the owner an email from the server.
blueprint mail {
  version "0.1.0"
  for platform
  requires server
  optional apps

  /// Who owns the platform: the email alerts, password resets and Let's
  /// Encrypt write to.
  option owner string required
  /// Who the platform's emails come from, e.g. Platform <no-reply@acme.com>,
  /// on a domain the provider sends for.
  option from string required
  /// resend: Resend, with its API key in the secrets (mail_api_key); smtp:
  /// any SMTP server, with its URL in the secrets (mail_smtp_url).
  option provider name default(resend)
}
